From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: telegram-custom <telegram-custom@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 01:02:50 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Trust model: media from untrusted chats waits for a tap

Chats you have not come to trust (docs/trust.md): no automatic downloads,
no network thumbnails (photos, documents, replies, link previews), no
autoplay (cached media included), animated and video stickers static,
no story preload, calls relay-only. Direct-URL web documents (fetched
from your own IP) never load while the model is on.

Trusted: Saved Messages, the service account, your own non-forwarded
messages, groups you created and channels you run, hand marks (people
decay after the grace period unless active), contacts active on N of
the last D days in your private chat (counted on this device). Stock
"Always"/"Never" lists read as marks. Chat menu item with the state
first; first refusal in the open chat shows a toast that trusts it;
settings under Advanced -> Automatic media download -> Media trust.
---
